      <section class="ae-approach ae-wrap ae-section" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
        <div class="ae-section-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="ae-eyebrow">03 / FROM INTENTION TO EXECUTION</p>
            <h2 id="approach-title">A clear process.<br /><em>A considered result.</em></h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            The best starting point is an honest conversation<br />about what you need, what exists today,<br />and what
            a useful outcome looks like.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ol class="ae-process">
          <li>
            <span class="ae-process-number">01</span>
            <h3>Understand.</h3>
            <p>
              Listen to the people doing the work. Define the problem, the constraints, and what success should mean.
            </p>
            <small>CONTEXT &amp; SCOPE</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ae-process-number">02</span>
            <h3>Make it tangible.</h3>
            <p>Bring the idea into view with clear structure, thoughtful copy, and a design you can respond to.</p>
            <small>DESIGN &amp; PROTOTYPE</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ae-process-number">03</span>
            <h3>Build with care.</h3>
            <p>Connect the pieces, test the important paths, and make the experience work across real devices.</p>
            <small>ENGINEERING &amp; REVIEW</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ae-process-number">04</span>
            <h3>Keep it useful.</h3>
            <p>Hand over something understandable, clarify what comes next, and refine it around real use.</p>
            <small>HANDOFF &amp; EVOLUTION</small>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="ae-pledge" id="pledge" aria-labelledby="pledge-title">
        <div class="ae-wrap ae-section">
          <div class="ae-pledge-intro">
            <p class="ae-eyebrow"><span class="ae-dot"></span> THE ETHICAL INTELLIGENCE PROJECT</p>
            <h2 id="pledge-title">Intelligence<br /><em>in service of people.</em></h2>
            <p>
              Our pledge is a way of doing the work: build with intention, explain what matters, and keep people in
              control of the decisions that affect them.
            </p>
            <a class="ae-link" href="/engineering/brand#voice"
              >Read the mission &amp; voice guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
            >
          </div>
          <ol class="ae-commitments">
            <li>
              <span>01</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Keep people in control.</h3>
                <p>Design for informed choices and meaningful human review.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>02</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Make the reasoning visible.</h3>
                <p>Explain sources, assumptions, and limits when they affect a decision.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>03</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Build for access.</h3>
                <p>Make understandable language, accessibility, and practical usability part of the work.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>04</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Respect what is entrusted to us.</h3>
                <p>Define what information is needed and how it will be handled before connecting it.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>05</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Make AI earn its place.</h3>
                <p>Use it where it helps someone complete a real task, and check the result against that task.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>06</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Stay accountable to the outcome.</h3>
                <p>Test the experience, explain its boundaries, and improve what people actually use.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ae-faq ae-wrap ae-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
        <div>
          <p class="ae-eyebrow">04 / A FEW GOOD QUESTIONS</p>
          <h2 id="faq-title">Before<br /><em>we begin.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ae-faq-list">
          <details>
            <summary>What kinds of projects are a good fit?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p>
              Small-business websites, thoughtful customer experiences, and practical AI tools are good places to start.
              We begin by understanding your work, then agree on a scope that can be designed, built, and reviewed
              clearly.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can we start small?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p>
              Yes. A focused website, a single workflow, or a design prototype can be a useful first step. The starting
              scope should fit the problem and your capacity to use the result.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How are cost and timing decided?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p>
              They depend on the scope, the content and systems already available, and the work needed to deliver the
              agreed outcome. Those details belong in the project conversation before work begins.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How does AI fit into the work?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p>
              We start with the task. AI can help organize information, guide a workflow, or draft something a person
              will review. Where evidence, calculation, or approval matters, the experience should make those checks
              clear.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Are the products connected to one account?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <p>
              Grant Intelligence and RAPID²AI are separate offerings. Visit each product to see its experience and
              available capabilities. The shared connection is the Atoma Engineering point of view and pledge.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ae-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <div class="ae-wrap ae-contact-grid ae-section">
          <div class="ae-contact-copy">
            <p class="ae-eyebrow">05 / SOMETHING WORTH BUILDING</p>
            <h2 id="contact-title">What could<br />we move<br /><em>forward?</em></h2>
            <p>Tell us a little about the work. Start with a project brief you can save and share.</p>
            <div class="ae-contact-placeholder">
              <span>PUBLIC CONTACT / PLACEHOLDER</span><b>hello@atoma.example</b><small
                >The public address will be added here.</small
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ae-brief-card">
            <form id="brief-form">
              <fieldset disabled id="brief-fields">
                <legend>Start with what you have in mind.</legend>
                <div class="ae-form-row">
                  <div>
                    <label for="brief-name">Your name <span>optional</span></label><input
                      id="brief-name"
                      name="name"
                      autocomplete="name"
                      maxlength="120"
                      placeholder="How should we address you?"
                    />
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <label for="brief-org">Business or organization <span>optional</span></label><input
                      id="brief-org"
                      name="organization"
                      autocomplete="organization"
                      maxlength="160"
                      placeholder="Who is this for?"
                    />
                  </div>
                </div>
                <label for="brief-type">What are you thinking about?</label><select id="brief-type" name="type">
                  <option value="website">A website or customer experience</option>
                  <option value="ai">An AI tool or workflow</option>
                  <option value="grants">Grant Intelligence</option>
                  <option value="explore">I would like to explore an idea</option></select
                ><label for="brief-goal">What would you like to make better?</label><textarea
                  id="brief-goal"
                  name="goal"
                  rows="4"
                  minlength="10"
                  maxlength="4000"
                  placeholder="A little context, the problem today, and what a useful result would look like…"
                  required></textarea><label for="brief-timing">When are you hoping to start?</label><select
                  id="brief-timing"
                  name="timing"
                >
                  <option>Just exploring</option>
                  <option>Within the next month</option>
                  <option>Within the next three months</option>
                  <option>I have a specific deadline to discuss</option></select
                ><button class="ae-button ae-button-blue" type="submit">
                  Create my project brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                </button>
                <p class="ae-form-note">Your draft stays in this page. Nothing is submitted.</p>
              </fieldset>
            </form>
            <noscript
              ><p>
                Enable JavaScript to compose a project brief. You can read all of our work and principles without it.
              </p></noscript
            >
            <section
              id="brief-result"
              class="ae-brief-result"
              aria-labelledby="brief-result-title"
              tabindex="-1"
              hidden
            >
              <p class="ae-eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO START</p>
              <h3 id="brief-result-title">Your project brief.</h3>
              <label class="ae-sr-only" for="brief-text">Project brief text</label><textarea
                id="brief-text"
                rows="13"
                readonly></textarea>
              <div class="ae-actions">
                <button class="ae-button ae-button-blue" type="button" id="copy-brief">
                  Copy brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button
                ><button class="ae-button" type="button" id="download-brief">
                  Download .txt <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
                </button>
              </div>
              <button class="ae-edit-brief" type="button" id="edit-brief">← Make a change</button>
              <p class="ae-form-note" id="brief-status" role="status">Ready to save. Your brief has not been sent.</p>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
